{"accepted_body_digest": "67c6c1d2182c20d6f2e173335dda75158bf29d4cfe850ecc0cb8a27e9d792ffc", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-001", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "67c6c1d2182c20d6f2e173335dda75158bf29d4cfe850ecc0cb8a27e9d792ffc", "first_pass_body_text": "晚班交接前，试衣间外还留着两件米白外套。导购没有替人讲品牌故事，只把它们重新挂到镜前：一件肩部更平，另一件抬手时背后更松。她说，先把难选的地方摆在一起看。衣服真正要接住的，是眼前这次犹豫。想再比，就带上常穿的内搭走两步。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-001", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "74b6a426c2258829ef7cdace386d3e117af0bd64e26c543a49c3e5ffdbcc5c9f", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-002", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "74b6a426c2258829ef7cdace386d3e117af0bd64e26c543a49c3e5ffdbcc5c9f", "first_pass_body_text": "后场刚拆完箱，台面上留了两件针织衫。负责人轻轻拉开领边，再松手看它怎么回位，又顺手捏了捏袖口罗纹。两件的反应并不一样。她没急着给这批货贴上漂亮形容词，只说这一批先别急着全挂出去，先把观察记下来，再往后查。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-002", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "d0ee5c7e4cc00cdf28e151d29c74e3bc68d9fe79bb80a347022c88b54fa1ef6a", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-003", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "d0ee5c7e4cc00cdf28e151d29c74e3bc68d9fe79bb80a347022c88b54fa1ef6a", "first_pass_body_text": "大衣已经快定版，领口却在最后一次扣合时起了皱。负责人把厚料摊平，和版师一起把弧线放缓，再别回人台上看翻折。她笑了一下：不是图上好看，布就一定肯配合。今天不讲宏大的认真，只留下这次改动；等样衣回来，还要再扣上、转头、复看。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-005", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "b23802b0c275aaf38abb36cc208868c78f43f6c4b953b2692702ae213afb6fb0", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-004", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "b23802b0c275aaf38abb36cc208868c78f43f6c4b953b2692702ae213afb6fb0", "first_pass_body_text": "七月的样衣间里，秋装大衣刚从工作台下来。负责人看了一眼介绍卡，把那些替人下结论的话划掉，转而翻开袖口记录针路，再请版师指一指肩线为什么这样落。能指给人看的，我们就说清楚；其余的先留白。内容不必替衣服抢答，也不必替顾客决定。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-006", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "8b8903ccc598d6adb9310240003575a3839beca4ed9c45d80792145c6a4a1b96", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-005", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "8b8903ccc598d6adb9310240003575a3839beca4ed9c45d80792145c6a4a1b96", "first_pass_body_text": "午后经过样衣架，我在第一件外套前停了一会儿。腰线只抬了一点，明扣收进门襟，领子也窄了些。这样的变化不需要反转音乐，更不用替谁安排情绪。先退后看比例，再走近看三处细节。小改动，就按小改动的样子讲，下一轮试穿再看它是否真的更顺。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-007", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "d50b5388e192ffc3734ed15e9d9c6a896ddaea3989860b16e6e0c09738749b42", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-006", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "d50b5388e192ffc3734ed15e9d9c6a896ddaea3989860b16e6e0c09738749b42", "first_pass_body_text": "打烊后，我把那段过分动人的开头删掉了。店里没有那位被写哭的顾客，也没人说过那些对白。留下来的只有这件棉衬衫：立领收窄，暗扣藏在门襟里，袖口斜纹在灯下很清楚。没发生过的，就别替别人感动。明早让导购拿着实物，再讲一次真的看见了什么。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-009", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "d9e7d66b2f42e79693ee10c67381ebcae7020d9df6e7aeb01e6ea89406e118e5", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-007", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "d9e7d66b2f42e79693ee10c67381ebcae7020d9df6e7aeb01e6ea89406e118e5", "first_pass_body_text": "靠窗那排衬衫很整齐，可我站在门口什么也没记住。于是先翻起砂色那件的领口，把整杆朝向调一致，再把颜色收成三段，腰线以下留一点空。整齐不够，还得让眼睛知道先看哪里。今天先这样开门，等自然光进来，再从入口复看一次。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-010", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "c1a05a3930242ad4e8490a5951c2043a80e790c7fc766cbab60017b83e9ebe2d", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-008", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "c1a05a3930242ad4e8490a5951c2043a80e790c7fc766cbab60017b83e9ebe2d", "first_pass_body_text": "上新前试讲了三遍，最常出现的词还是好看。我把外套挂近一点，先让同事看翻领的角度，再顺门襟往下指扣位，最后翻开袖口。别把好看当成答案，选一处你真能指出来的细节再开口。她挑了袖口，下一遍就从手上的动作讲起。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-011", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "68bd82762ca896da6b93368a8c2542c23eb962da050be128f5314f68110dc925", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-009", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "68bd82762ca896da6b93368a8c2542c23eb962da050be128f5314f68110dc925", "first_pass_body_text": "推文发出前，我又把那件长风衣穿了一次。肩部向下走得直，布带松开时前襟自然分开，走动时下摆留着空间。我把原来那句身体结论删掉，只留下眼睛能核对的状态：我只讲这件衣服现在怎么落。想知道适不适合，还是要把腰带松开、系上，各试一次。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-013", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "bee95464e61f86746b3d343ade82db3b1f0270b214213c43e8c86fba89e6dd37", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-010", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "bee95464e61f86746b3d343ade82db3b1f0270b214213c43e8c86fba89e6dd37", "first_pass_body_text": "闭店后，我把推文里那句夸张的话删了第三次。驼色大衣挂到镜前，肩部平直，腰后暗褶把下摆轻轻撑开，袖口则收得干净。这三处看得见，就够讲一条了。至于穿在谁身上是什么感觉，不由文字抢答；想看，就约个时间到店照一次镜子。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-015", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "e4baa4a59a7564fcfe190e103168131a253ec040612e22fff44966fafd91d9ad", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-011", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "e4baa4a59a7564fcfe190e103168131a253ec040612e22fff44966fafd91d9ad", "first_pass_body_text": "早会看完排期板，六条风衣内容像同一句话写了六遍。我把白T、阔腿裤、针织裙和卫衣分进四个格子，让同一件风衣分别接住通勤、周末、叠穿和换季。衣服没换，问题可以换。下一条只拍周末那组，不再把通勤卖点换个标题重说。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-016", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "160b4cbca37c98d67f2e385d772f9658dd7e3fb891974d79e594b9f587c5bba0", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-012", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "160b4cbca37c98d67f2e385d772f9658dd7e3fb891974d79e594b9f587c5bba0", "first_pass_body_text": "挂样墙排到第三遍，我先停下来数手里的素材。水洗牛仔外套有平铺图，也有袖口车线特写，却没有真实上身动作。料不够，就先别装成一整个系列。今天只做一条细节记录，等上身段补齐，再按平铺、动作、局部三种形态排成连续内容。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-018", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "f6c2083101d20ccde90fbb3422effb70a5b96bb4041ab0682939243245a9cb7a", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-013", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "f6c2083101d20ccde90fbb3422effb70a5b96bb4041ab0682939243245a9cb7a", "first_pass_body_text": "我正把门口风衣的腰带重新绕好。同一件衣服，买手先说为什么选它，搭配师比较直筒裤和阔腿裤的重心，导购只讲顾客上身后先动哪一处。岗位不同，先看的地方也不同。今天不让三个人背同一段话；下一班，导购只录最容易照做的那个动作。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-019", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "88aa60bc10d3e62e39db4779bd4f49d5e75eff10c309aacd91f98109a1587b56", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-014", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "88aa60bc10d3e62e39db4779bd4f49d5e75eff10c309aacd91f98109a1587b56", "first_pass_body_text": "开门前，我穿上新到的卡其风衣走了两步。先说动作：腰带松挽，转身。再说观察：下摆跟着动，肩部落点清楚。至于为什么适合谁，只能留成可能。做过什么、看见什么、猜什么，别揉成一句。导购听完，按这三个层次重录了自己的版本。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-020", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "9b57d3611d09b875bbd5c432eed84c83cfe397e94ee11378b651a6fe533eb159", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-015", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "9b57d3611d09b875bbd5c432eed84c83cfe397e94ee11378b651a6fe533eb159", "first_pass_body_text": "我刚把橱窗里的大衣肩部重新理顺。它静静挂着，肩部被衣料的分量压住，下摆落到小腿附近，风口开着也没有乱成一团。旧稿原本借了一个顾客故事，我把它撤掉了。不借谁的私事，这件衣服也有东西可讲。路过时，可以近一点看它怎么垂下来。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-023", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "eb4f9f27c7d9ae7f4bc24eac633d06bc9c3cbfef36da4376468d66e2fbcbc0b6", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-016", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "eb4f9f27c7d9ae7f4bc24eac633d06bc9c3cbfef36da4376468d66e2fbcbc0b6", "first_pass_body_text": "上新前，我把水洗牛仔外套又翻了一遍。袖口双线走得平，铜扣就在眼前，肩缝落在哪里也能穿上看。可耐磨、不掉色这些话，仅凭一眼说不出来。语气再肯定，也不能替记录作证。今天先讲三处实物，水洗和穿着资料齐了，再决定下一段怎么写。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-024", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.011173, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-012"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "d23076742672d2976f24d3d4f94cf167ab6a31957e3fe4f7f26b83740f667dd8", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-017", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "d23076742672d2976f24d3d4f94cf167ab6a31957e3fe4f7f26b83740f667dd8", "first_pass_body_text": "店还没开，我正站在驼色大衣墙前分派今天的讲法。买手只说为什么把它放进这批货，陈列师讲它怎样稳住两侧灰蓝针织，导购则准备回答上身先看哪里。只说你这个岗位真正碰过的那一层。三个人不抢同一句，整件衣服反而更完整。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-026", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "e2c87cd2ffdb573cc08b4be859888540a13d3254a2c92a73f0edcecb8544b4c6", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-018", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "e2c87cd2ffdb573cc08b4be859888540a13d3254a2c92a73f0edcecb8544b4c6", "first_pass_body_text": "开门前，我们围着中岛那件驼色大衣重新对了一次话。买手只讲为何选择落肩与扣子，陈列师说它该放在哪个高度，导购演示腰带松开和收起的两种状态。一件衣服可以有三种入口，但不能有三套事实。三段各自署上岗位，之后谁接着讲，也知道边界在哪里。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-027", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "f484a6140efbb0c40fe3325e40bdb2f41130007ecbb10be3d91d99c14ac19b74", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-019", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "f484a6140efbb0c40fe3325e40bdb2f41130007ecbb10be3d91d99c14ac19b74", "first_pass_body_text": "我正蹲在中岛边，把灯芯绒裤脚往回折半寸。买手账本里它有代号，陈列时又成了画面中心，可面对顾客，只需要说眼前这些：暖光下绒色偏红，腰头明线清楚，裤长会随鞋跟变化。后场怎么叫它可以变，面对顾客讲什么不能乱。开门后再配两双鞋试给人看。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-028", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "6f09d8ceacd71d4abd17489c430773276ea816544c2932a56385b4d5ddbf9fc0", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-020", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-01", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "6f09d8ceacd71d4abd17489c430773276ea816544c2932a56385b4d5ddbf9fc0", "first_pass_body_text": "烟灰百褶裙的推文在待发箱里躺了一整天。我把买手账本里的补货判断移走，只留下顾客能看见的部分：腰头收着活褶，走两步时裙摆会荡出一圈弧。账本里的话，不必全搬到顾客眼前。发布前再请买手看一遍，公开内容与内部经营各回各的位置。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-030", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005181, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-019"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "c4b0a4b8226f1580dd87e7e57a0cdbeba28d75f6544b7c66cf25b4bfd6648e1c", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-021", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "c4b0a4b8226f1580dd87e7e57a0cdbeba28d75f6544b7c66cf25b4bfd6648e1c", "first_pass_body_text": "我已经穿着这条雾蓝阔腿裤走到镜前了。第一次接触这类裤型，先看整体垂下来是什么样，不必一开口就塞满细节。有人继续问，我再靠近讲腰头明线、裤脚压鞋面多少。第一次看，先把整条裤子看懂；熟悉以后，再把信息往深处拆。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-031", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "72d8aa5a2bff121b267f0dbdc673049570d5a6864364281deab4c021de186251", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-022", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "72d8aa5a2bff121b267f0dbdc673049570d5a6864364281deab4c021de186251", "first_pass_body_text": "开播前，我把风衣的讲法拆成了两层。刚进来的人先看翻领、整体长度和腰带松开时的状态；已经比较过几次的人，再往里看暗门襟、扣位和叠穿。不是每个人都需要同样多的信息。不知道对方走到哪一步，就先讲浅一点；等问题具体了，再把那一层打开。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-033", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "d347f89d9999a9fd2f67b1470d50c8184f7c70f9862853d336ba4fd48e91f355", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-023", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "d347f89d9999a9fd2f67b1470d50c8184f7c70f9862853d336ba4fd48e91f355", "first_pass_body_text": "我正准备给燕麦开衫配字，手停在一句太满的话前。拿起实物，粗针竖纹、哑光扣和收高的领口都在眼前，这些足够把冬日的感觉讲出来。暖意可以说，没根据的年限不能说。先发布可见细节，成分与穿着记录补齐后，再决定是否多写一步。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-035", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "1b17381d5ea1659e5a18c62a3428eb2542eafeed04a58cb518430e0f0fc69513", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-024", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "1b17381d5ea1659e5a18c62a3428eb2542eafeed04a58cb518430e0f0fc69513", "first_pass_body_text": "开播前，我又把深蓝牛仔裤的提词卡顺了一遍。直筒轮廓、裤缝和拉链都能拿到手机前展示，走两步也能看出裤脚怎么落。再往后的身体效果，我用红笔删掉。好感可以慢慢加，结论不能凭气氛加。直播里先让人看，再按自己的身高和场景继续问。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-036", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "91cd48a7f0bde774745b8a55aec344fbf8cbddc35ec601289ce7a05e27933775", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-025", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "91cd48a7f0bde774745b8a55aec344fbf8cbddc35ec601289ce7a05e27933775", "first_pass_body_text": "我正在收银台上逐句清理一篇上新稿。熟客的名字和过去经历全部删掉，搭配师替衣服作保证的句子也撤下。留下的是能现场做的事：看收窄袖口，翻下领口，比较腰带松开与系起。人的履历不拿来卖衣服，穿法照样能讲清。明天让导购匿名示范一遍。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-038", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "3ad41730eb52f9453adf6a49f0688f0c67e402e44b35745e246877fb532c9640", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-026", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "3ad41730eb52f9453adf6a49f0688f0c67e402e44b35745e246877fb532c9640", "first_pass_body_text": "闭店后，我把直播卡摊开，先划掉最响亮的一句。版师懂结构，不代表能替时间保证一条裤子会怎样。明天直播只演示两件事：裤线现在是否平，蹲下再站起时膝部当下怎么恢复。懂版型的人，也不能替时间作保证；耐用问题等水洗和穿着记录来回答。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-039", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005435, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-010"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "6a44a49e0086267f6a1a1f9c314d11d52b74f4eb98161a5c30d97355657f767c", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-027", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "6a44a49e0086267f6a1a1f9c314d11d52b74f4eb98161a5c30d97355657f767c", "first_pass_body_text": "上新桌堆满衣服时，我先不写标题，先把它们分开：贴身穿的上装放一边，裤裙归到下装，一件到底的单独放，最外层再成一组。拿起其中一件上装，先看领型，再看袖长和轮廓。先给衣服找到位置，再谈它有什么；资料没核到的部分，不在这一步抢答。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-041", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "aeac9d4556386f3f9fd051c082786a1afd0370add97a5faf9029f5aa3ee7b985", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-028", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "aeac9d4556386f3f9fd051c082786a1afd0370add97a5faf9029f5aa3ee7b985", "first_pass_body_text": "我手里这件米白西装，先不报一串参数。靠近看，表面有细斜纹；手捏起来有些分量；扣上以后，腰部轮廓会收一点。眼前能看的先看，标签上的等标签。你想继续看领口、袖长还是整体版型，可以接着问；成分与克重没有核对前，我不会把它说成确定信息。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-042", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "357c921ae3ac244d539937490c451c684051bc5d59b26787ca732a2f240c7417", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-029", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "357c921ae3ac244d539937490c451c684051bc5d59b26787ca732a2f240c7417", "first_pass_body_text": "两件通勤大衣并排时，我先把它们拉到同一束光下。左边长到小腿，线条直；右边停在胯部附近，轮廓更向内收。接着才看厚薄和缝线。至于哪件更暖、更耐穿，单靠这次观察回答不了。同类对比，先统一尺子，把能在当场核对的四项记下来就够了。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-043", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "8151053b8442a20ec3c1cfefc32d3e10c622ebde79d1feade5f81835afa7bd3b", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-030", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "8151053b8442a20ec3c1cfefc32d3e10c622ebde79d1feade5f81835afa7bd3b", "first_pass_body_text": "这两件同色大衣，我先举到同一高度。左边线条直，长度到膝附近；右边腰部收起，下摆短一些。你问哪件更暖、更耐穿，我能帮你比结构，性能要看资料。平时步行多还是主要在室内，也会影响你更在意长度还是活动空间。把场景说清，我们再往下比。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-044", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.016304, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-029"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "261c94fe45055ee5c599f270a0164550ba64463ded5c7bc2e982c034d0d2bc35", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-031", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "261c94fe45055ee5c599f270a0164550ba64463ded5c7bc2e982c034d0d2bc35", "first_pass_body_text": "两件浅色上衣挂在一起时，我先把袖口提到窗边。一边的线条纵横压得紧，轻拉后变化不大；另一边能看见线圈相连，手上拉开会跟着伸展。别先猜手感，先看线是怎么连起来的。结构能帮助解释眼前差异，但不能单凭这一幕替性能作结论。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-047", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "4dbaf21a8bfba2c38174347e16b835f164317eb844047701979a59ad63924ea7", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-032", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "4dbaf21a8bfba2c38174347e16b835f164317eb844047701979a59ad63924ea7", "first_pass_body_text": "桌上这两块布，一块是格纹梭织，一块能明显拉开的针织。我先把它们靠近手机：梭织的交错方向保持得更稳，针织线圈受力会伸开，松手后再回去。手上能演示结构，保暖不能靠这一拉就定。你想看表面还是回位，我可以继续做；性能问题等资料回答。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-048", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005319, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-029"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "45050f72d6b599f5f583b603f448ad9df81f7d235890e579bd335fffe62c40fc", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-033", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "45050f72d6b599f5f583b603f448ad9df81f7d235890e579bd335fffe62c40fc", "first_pass_body_text": "这件雾蓝开衫，我换了三个位置才开始写颜色。窗边天光下偏冷，暖灯一开，灰感更明显；打开手机预览，自动曝光又会改变屏幕里的明暗。颜色没变，观察它的光先变了。做颜色记录时，把光线条件一起写下，比只给一个绝对色名更诚实。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-050", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "54db4f73047b80c091daeb0a59f326e4e0229c0c261c475d359bab8d712889de", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-034", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "54db4f73047b80c091daeb0a59f326e4e0229c0c261c475d359bab8d712889de", "first_pass_body_text": "我手上是砖红灯芯绒衬衫，先转一下让绒条吃到侧光。明暗会沿着纹理变化，暖灯下颜色也更深。我再放一件中性色内搭作参照。颜色可以拆开看，身体效果得本人试。你常在冷白办公室还是暖光环境，可以告诉我；我只比较眼前的色相、明暗与冷暖。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-051", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "9f7a59ca20c34deebba9630d2818addca70a79bd765e4eab01a6109f915a433c", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-035", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "9f7a59ca20c34deebba9630d2818addca70a79bd765e4eab01a6109f915a433c", "first_pass_body_text": "这件燕麦西装上身后，我先找四个位置：肩点落在哪里，腰位在什么高度，衣长停到哪儿，袖窿留了多少空间。落肩会改变肩部走向，腰位会动上下比例，衣长又影响整体重心。先把结构点找出来，再看外面形成什么形，术语才不会飘在画面外。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-052", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "48a450b54b41755b14e41bd741f0e7e79469cbe89b28f73a6493f4adaf540084", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-036", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "48a450b54b41755b14e41bd741f0e7e79469cbe89b28f73a6493f4adaf540084", "first_pass_body_text": "人台上这条雾蓝裙，我先移动肩缝的别针，再把腰位标记往上挪一点，最后折起下摆比较长度。肩线一动，外轮廓会松；腰位改变，视觉重心也跟着走。里面动半寸，外面就会换一个重心。人台只帮助看结构，真实穿着还要本人上身再判断。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-054", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "49c40cc40ada3ec4efe8f651bd1050f6f983f712fe7d22a7f0b53c7d6d770c78", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-037", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "49c40cc40ada3ec4efe8f651bd1050f6f983f712fe7d22a7f0b53c7d6d770c78", "first_pass_body_text": "木台上这件浅灰衬衫，我没有一开始就数针脚。先把整件展开，看外观是否顺；再打开门襟，看结构怎样连接；最后才靠近纽扣孔、袖口包边和领口压线。先认整件，再往里面看。这个顺序能让细节有来路，也避免把一串局部写成没有重点的参数表。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-056", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "2c8cc3968495c3ae2a09505fdd176e06002e670024d5bb7c6b70e117fa31e566", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-038", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "2c8cc3968495c3ae2a09505fdd176e06002e670024d5bb7c6b70e117fa31e566", "first_pass_body_text": "这件外套先看整体，再翻到里面。门襟的纽扣孔能靠近看，袖口包边有没有盖住布边也看得清，领口双针是否规整同样可以展示。做工可以给你看，寿命不能靠这一眼说满。你点一个位置，我继续靠近；耐用问题留给长期穿着与记录。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-057", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005435, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-032"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "a2000a5b0f4b3c6c5fcbf5e3a33d3d7597109214c12b2eed492da20bbd415024", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-039", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "a2000a5b0f4b3c6c5fcbf5e3a33d3d7597109214c12b2eed492da20bbd415024", "first_pass_body_text": "靠窗这件长风衣，我先让前襟自然敞开。领口到下摆形成连续竖线，腰带没有收紧，走动时两侧会分开。这里能说的是线条与衣服在身体周围的位置关系，再往前就是替人写身体答案。线条可以讲，身体答案不能替人写。把观察、关系、结果分三层检查，会稳很多。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-058", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "5ac72ea5d70b9a5eca50be19de6a961a9e7e012e092c1162193dab4472d87bdb", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-040", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-02", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "5ac72ea5d70b9a5eca50be19de6a961a9e7e012e092c1162193dab4472d87bdb", "first_pass_body_text": "这组是竖纹衬衫配直筒长裤。我先站着让线条连起来，再坐下看前片，最后起身走两步。手机能记录竖向关系怎样延续，也能看到动作后的衣物状态。我只演示线怎么走，不替你下身体结论。你是久坐开会还是走动通勤，我们就接着看对应动作。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-060", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "ab35244ae8cb4b8edfa5e975746b637edf0d5dff15efe63b3b1ae9ea1bb7fbeb", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-041", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-03", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "ab35244ae8cb4b8edfa5e975746b637edf0d5dff15efe63b3b1ae9ea1bb7fbeb", "first_pass_body_text": "打烊后拍牛仔外套，我先做了一个弯肘动作。门襟双线能靠近看，肘部已有的浅色褶也在画面里，翻领扣起后会不会外翻同样可观察。这些都能照实说。耐磨、不掉色、久穿不松却要更长的记录。眼前的细节照实说，时间才知道的先等。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-061", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005556, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-016"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "fc27c9d9023f66b4f426aa2c1c276a2674d31884d43c67d46b8b67555706e1f4", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-042", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-03", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "fc27c9d9023f66b4f426aa2c1c276a2674d31884d43c67d46b8b67555706e1f4", "first_pass_body_text": "收播后我把那条牛仔裤重新拿到手机前。水洗颜色、直筒裤腿和缝线都能当场看到，也可以穿上走动比较。耐磨、久坐是否变形、身体效果却不是一场直播能证明的。看得到的先答，必须测试的就等测试。你想看轮廓还是细节，我继续展开。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-063", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005435, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-024"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "843c7d67d3513bf1495ca80c6d6029c95612ef13f2c466e715b7c3b1ffe8058a", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-043", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-03", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "843c7d67d3513bf1495ca80c6d6029c95612ef13f2c466e715b7c3b1ffe8058a", "first_pass_body_text": "暖灯下看燕麦毛衣，我先把袖口翻到手边。罗纹怎样收、肩部拼接是否对位、织纹是否连贯，都能用眼睛和手指核对。含量、等级、认证与长期耐穿则不在这次观察里。局部做工是线索，不是整件品质的万能证明。把两类话分开，发布前就不容易越界。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-064", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005405, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-031"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "f00a84e734845bea7713ecfd775ddde35156566c869716ca5938d4b7b06b2629", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-044", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-03", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "f00a84e734845bea7713ecfd775ddde35156566c869716ca5938d4b7b06b2629", "first_pass_body_text": "我先把直筒牛仔裤的裤脚翻起来。收口线迹能数，内缝走向看得见，后袋两片布的接缝也可以靠近看。看完再把裤脚放回原位，观察整体。可是这几处只能证明自己，不能替整条裤子盖章。耐久和身体结果需要别的证据，你想看哪一处，我继续靠近。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-066", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005464, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-038"}
