{"accepted_body_digest": "0ce4614ee45b5f9544330b14145a4f7a0391c2cdd3179955cc2de7072cb6f73a", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-051", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-03", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "0ce4614ee45b5f9544330b14145a4f7a0391c2cdd3179955cc2de7072cb6f73a", "first_pass_body_text": "我已经从门口往里走，先不急着靠近衣服。入口要看整个空间和第一落点；到中岛再收近，看一套搭配怎样组合；走到端架，才靠近翻领缉线、扣子和袖口。走到哪一区，就换哪一种看法。下次到店，可以在这三个位置各停一下，看看自己先被什么吸引。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-076", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "c2ebc70e4fcbffd6d6d2527d365fd54aaf37a05d58796d23a9438dac0576efe9", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-052", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-03", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "c2ebc70e4fcbffd6d6d2527d365fd54aaf37a05d58796d23a9438dac0576efe9", "first_pass_body_text": "第三遍看陈列标注，我把一句太满的话划掉了。焦糖灯芯绒裤放在端架，近一点能看绒条方向；回到挂通的中距离，可以看裤腿怎样落下来。陈列能告诉你去哪看，不能替衣服下所有结论。身体效果与品质等级先不写，等人真正上身、资料真正到位再说。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-078", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.010753, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-023"}
