{"accepted_body_digest": "78c255b55092f7d1c3e79ea4a49cf73a4248370051ea0e0de7fd3258e4af93ed", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-061", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "78c255b55092f7d1c3e79ea4a49cf73a4248370051ea0e0de7fd3258e4af93ed", "first_pass_body_text": "我正在把墨绿西装的翻领重新压到衬衫领外，再把巧克力色直筒裤的裤缝对正，灯往主推位斜一点。这套方法谁都可以照着做。实习生问要不要顺便讲合作与授权，我说不必：摆法可以教，合同里的事不在这条里讲。制度问题走正式渠道，画面只留陈列动作。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-091", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "c750734c0e6c0b41421e604eeac8adf80ed87f8e690c37c1371d11e1a2c92104", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-062", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "c750734c0e6c0b41421e604eeac8adf80ed87f8e690c37c1371d11e1a2c92104", "first_pass_body_text": "打烊前，导购已经把中岛那摞衣服抱了下来。我们先把灯芯绒夹克对半立码，让绒条朝向一致，再把白衬衫和直筒裤的竖线落在台边。她还想换掉主推配色，我让这一步先停。会做这个动作，不等于能改所有决定。明天由陈列负责人确认后再动。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-092", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "db1b6eb3cf843952d59241c291c89051a4279c32ddf922bc873bb93281f2dbe3", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-063", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "db1b6eb3cf843952d59241c291c89051a4279c32ddf922bc873bb93281f2dbe3", "first_pass_body_text": "橱窗刚擦好，我又把酒红半裙的褶子理了一遍。褶向、腰头和走动时的下摆都能当场看见，小牌就写这些。显瘦、首发、到货色系若没有确认，不因为牌子空着就随手补上。牌子写得少一点，未知就不会被假装成已知。资料到了，再单独更新。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-094", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005556, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-042"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "14bbaa873f4d6830cbb4d0fc4daf1afe3ae1a32bf9daa7323890c4e2b8421eff", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-064", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "14bbaa873f4d6830cbb4d0fc4daf1afe3ae1a32bf9daa7323890c4e2b8421eff", "first_pass_body_text": "晚班复核稿件时，我把最顺口的那句按住了。墨绿灯芯绒半裙的绒条、腰头衬里和侧缝拉链都能拿近看，也能用手感受当下状态；长期耐洗与几年后的变化却不在眼前。手能摸到的照实写，时间才知道的先停。成分、克重和洗护记录齐了，再回来复核。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-095", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.016484, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-041"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "eac1cc6222190366b47c51649c4f3c0c7acf80f67460900771a13e9ac2591e3e", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-065", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "eac1cc6222190366b47c51649c4f3c0c7acf80f67460900771a13e9ac2591e3e", "first_pass_body_text": "清晨那段内容，我没有先把风衣推到手机前。先放好通勤包和水杯，人物准备出门时，才从椅背拿起卡其风衣，腰带轻收，门襟保留一点活动空间。衣服先解决一件事，再谈它是不是主角。这样观众看到的是一次出门选择，不是商品突然闯进生活。试穿时再比较敞穿与收腰。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-098", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "b8f6f4ee3ef7d47785fea5f6ebcfc5365e2d833cba321c87d2536c66f915afdd", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-066", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "b8f6f4ee3ef7d47785fea5f6ebcfc5365e2d833cba321c87d2536c66f915afdd", "first_pass_body_text": "这件燕麦风衣先不报卖点。下班后你是要步行一段，还是直接开车？如果要走路，可以把领口立起、门襟扣到中段，腰带在身后松系；如果一直在车里，就先看敞开时是否顺手。先说你要去哪，再看这件衣服怎么跟上。穿法能演示，身体效果不在这里作保证。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-099", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "965733a26e83792908980154f65d0f68136e93c60af9a8f27e10299ceb18634e", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-067", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "965733a26e83792908980154f65d0f68136e93c60af9a8f27e10299ceb18634e", "first_pass_body_text": "午后中岛这组搭配，先让橄榄绿夹克站在中心。大贴袋、铜扣和翻立领都有清楚落点，焦糖灯芯绒裤把颜色接暖，米色高领只做缓冲。结尾别把人拽去结账，带回刚才那处细节：如果你常穿深色裤装，到店可以把两组颜色并排，看哪一组更接近自己的日常。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-100", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.010363, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-052"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "20158e279254665711bc8dfdde4e4d5b0eb714ef03ad2952be37f7e8112f295c", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-068", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "20158e279254665711bc8dfdde4e4d5b0eb714ef03ad2952be37f7e8112f295c", "first_pass_body_text": "我手里是白衬衫，先把领口解开一点，再把袖子挽到小臂。开会时可以把线条收得整齐，日常走动时再松开一处。你更多是哪种场景？看懂一个动作，再决定要不要继续试。今天不在结尾催单，只把领口与袖口两种变化摆出来，穿在自己身上再选。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-101", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005464, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-054"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "cbf9bcfaaae437997779caaca43feb619ce91c56e33c450ea31f876c98d0f055", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-069", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "cbf9bcfaaae437997779caaca43feb619ce91c56e33c450ea31f876c98d0f055", "first_pass_body_text": "风衣第一次上架，我只做了三件事：把它挂正，让人看清长度和宽松轮廓，再把腰带放到容易看见的位置。没有急着拆插肩、翻领与多种穿法。第一次见面，先让人认得它。等有人愿意停下来，下一条再往细处走。内容多少，要跟这件衣服此刻被认识到哪一步匹配。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-104", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "07c982eb0465825a2068ce7a25659bb925d6c32f83cf51a60c9817e27fe4467a", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-070", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "07c982eb0465825a2068ce7a25659bb925d6c32f83cf51a60c9817e27fe4467a", "first_pass_body_text": "同一件米白风衣，第一次见只看轮廓；已经看过几次，再靠近插肩和翻领；准备搭配时，它又可以退到组合里。不是换一件衣服，是换它这次要承担的任务。你是第一次看到，还是已经比较过几次？我按你的熟悉程度继续讲，不用一次把所有信息塞满。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-105", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.015873, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-022"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "96d0adebb64ae0078a42242a381946f2e37dec8d9fe830dda7d9a0236aece40a", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-071", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "96d0adebb64ae0078a42242a381946f2e37dec8d9fe830dda7d9a0236aece40a", "first_pass_body_text": "秋装到货后，我在长桌上重新排了一组。姜黄粗针毛衣先领头，橄榄绿丝巾把姜黄与藏青裤子接起来，焦茶帽子只补住画面上方。一组衣服里，不是每件都要站在最前面。先分清领头、连接和补位，再决定拍到哪一层；换平台时删信息，也不会把关系删散。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-107", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "70190d708aeaaf3695559ef0b8788e762e1707ff8ecaba716706e898134d6179", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-072", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "70190d708aeaaf3695559ef0b8788e762e1707ff8ecaba716706e898134d6179", "first_pass_body_text": "我先拿铁锈红夹克放到手机正面，它负责领头；芥末背心只露一点，把红色与灰调接起来；德训鞋补住画面下方。实物可以慢慢看，直播先把角色讲清。你更想换接色那件，还是换补位的鞋？我们可以当场替换，再看这组关系是否还站得住。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-108", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "ea64776ff7eb12b2e098b6e60157960f4111c3660955d9cbd887743f557d3872", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-073", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "ea64776ff7eb12b2e098b6e60157960f4111c3660955d9cbd887743f557d3872", "first_pass_body_text": "选外搭前，我会先问四件事：要走多远，坐下起身多不多，室内外温差怎样，还要带什么。步行一长，下摆若总扫腿，就把外搭层次往上收，内层换成能塞进裤腰的短打。百搭不是答案，今天要做什么才是。把真实行程带进试衣间，选择会具体很多。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-110", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "a61773513ec86eee52ebb55c6d38a80f8cab19a25e15b21d89a56b1b909b5d17", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-074", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "a61773513ec86eee52ebb55c6d38a80f8cab19a25e15b21d89a56b1b909b5d17", "first_pass_body_text": "这套是直筒西装裤配针织背心。坐下、起身、拿文件时，可以观察裤腰与背心是否保持位置；如果行程还要骑车，腿部动作变大，问题就不同了。同一套衣服，换一个动作，边界就出来了。你是全天室内，还是还要骑车、走很远？先说行程，我们再判断这套要不要调整。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-111", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "89f97970ad5372978b1d8cd3678dc51ce5c4a15d625e50024b398dd091b8a8ef", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-075", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "89f97970ad5372978b1d8cd3678dc51ce5c4a15d625e50024b398dd091b8a8ef", "first_pass_body_text": "同一束光下，我先穿短打，再套敞开的棉衬衫，最后加针织背心。每加一层都停一下：翻多少领口，袖口露多少，腰侧抽绳只收多少。怎么穿可以一步步看，穿了会怎样别抢着定。把顺序保存下来，再按自己的内搭厚度重做一次，才知道哪一步适合你。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-112", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005376, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-029"}
{"accepted_body_digest": "217c4ca6d70853b38f609725f16ace0bb70dc6b060930c0754a9af8182e0ed57", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-076", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "217c4ca6d70853b38f609725f16ace0bb70dc6b060930c0754a9af8182e0ed57", "first_pass_body_text": "我先穿针织开衫，再把风衣罩上。领口翻出大约两指宽，袖口留一点层次，最后调后腰的隐藏扣，看外轮廓当下怎么变化。我演示的是调法，不替你宣布结果。你的内搭偏薄还是有明显厚度？告诉我以后，我们再决定领口露多少、后腰收在哪一档。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-114", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
