{"accepted_body_digest": "8d3639be07f77ff08f5e95879a8b3fd6b9effc6f51892148d5858fd06050d574", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-078", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "8d3639be07f77ff08f5e95879a8b3fd6b9effc6f51892148d5858fd06050d574", "first_pass_body_text": "这排挂通先看中间的主推，它是主角。右边同色针织像一句顺着说下去的话，左边硬挺梭织则给出材质对比，延伸款退到后方。主角、逗号和背景，挂杆上也分得出来。你更喜欢顺色还是材质对比？选一个方向，我再拿对应组合给你看。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-117", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "d678ec223790006db808b4896cd234dfe4078f84398635669b1e4ec9b780e095", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-079", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "d678ec223790006db808b4896cd234dfe4078f84398635669b1e4ec9b780e095", "first_pass_body_text": "早班练米色风衣口播时，导购讲穿法，品牌稿想讲态度，设计说明又要拆结构，三种声音挤在一起。我让导购先站在前面，只拿腰带、落肩和门襟说清怎样穿；其他角度记进本子，留给以后。一次只让一种声音站在前面，产品才不会被口吻淹没。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-119", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.0, "nearest_prior_asset_id": null}
{"accepted_body_digest": "fd140b3ffa5d19c57540f83a879ffda1468a6b88918610a766ba15301aa8e62c", "asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-080", "bounded_correction_used": false, "checkpoint_id": "RV80-CP-04", "failure_codes": [], "first_pass_body_digest": "fd140b3ffa5d19c57540f83a879ffda1468a6b88918610a766ba15301aa8e62c", "first_pass_body_text": "同一件外套放在橱窗中心时，我会把完整轮廓讲清；移到针织旁边作陪衬，只露领口和一层颜色；带人走向试衣间时，它又可以指向下一条阔腿裤。它站在哪个位置，就说那个位置该说的话。你想先看外套本身，还是看它怎样接进整套搭配？我按当前任务继续。", "kernel_id": "SCM120-CAND-120", "machine_status": "PASS", "max_prior_jaccard": 0.005155, "nearest_prior_asset_id": "RV80-ASSET-070"}
